{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "rates-project-evap-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.58: `rates-project-evap`, the Rates-scale twin of `project-offnetwork`'s evaporative half: THC permeation, fuel vapor venting and fuel leaks for passenger cars in PROJECT domain, computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE plus the PROJECT input database `inputs/washtenaw-project-offnetwork.esm` (link 1 on road type 4 and the off-network link 2). moves.rs captured it with the execution database named MOVESExecution, which RatePostProcessorRatesFirst.sql's PROJECT branch hardcodes, as `rates-project` was.\n\nIts oracle is the six Rates tables. MOVES writes 128 RatePerVehicle rows (permeation and leaks on the off-network link) and 64 RatePerProfile rows (venting there), each the off-network link's inventory over the PROJECT population: ActivityCalculator.sql's ProjectDomain section writes population on the off-network link alone, as the zone's offNetworkLink fleet x ageFraction x the fuel share, and the post-processor sums it over road type 1's links. RatePerDistance is EMPTY: the run selects no running exhaust, so there is no distance activity to divide link 1's rows by (`run_writesDistance`), as in `rates-venting`.\n\nWHAT IT EXERCISES, behind `run_isProjectDomain`: that population (`act_projectPopulation`, the fleet x ageFraction, through `coh_population`). The pre-port model emitted every key and was 120 times low on every rate: it divided by the county's DEFAULT-domain population. Nothing else is Rates-specific -- EvaporativeEmissionsOperatingModeDistributionGenerator and TankTemperatureGenerator have no Rates branch in use and ProjectTAG's SHP and SourceHours none at all. A PROJECT Rates run whose evaporative rows would reach RatePerDistance is still refused (`run_ratesProjectEvapDistance`).\n\n`n_outputRate` IS 384: the output relation's evaporative rows on both links, of which the Rates tables are flagged subsets. `run_domainUnported` is 0; before §7.3.58 it was 3.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "runspec",
      "onroad",
      "project-domain",
      "rates",
      "rates-project"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
